  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "PosterLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL RESEARCH EXAMPLE / STUDIO FIELD ATLAS 01"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Understanding tool library instructions"
    },
    {
      "style": "PosterLead",
      "text": "Return instructions need another test"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "A bounded usability study for a fictional lending team deciding what to revise before a supervised pilot."
    },
    {
      "style": "PosterLabel",
      "text": "Reading route 01 Claim / 02 Method / 03 Evidence"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "01 Circle Claim"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Observed difficulty supports revising the return instructions and testing them again. It does not…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading3",
      "text": "Question"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Can first-time visitors use the draft notice to identify how to borrow a tool and where to return it?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading3",
      "text": "Counterevidence"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Five of the eleven recorded return outcomes succeeded without help. The difficulty was not universal;…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading3",
      "text": "Decision and next step"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Revise the return destination and staff-handoff wording. Ask a lending-team member to verify the real…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading3",
      "text": "Status"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "REVISION PROPOSED. No rollout approved. Safety, loan rules and staffing need separate operational review."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "02 Wedge Method"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Twelve fictional session records model one round with first-time visitors. Everyone received the same…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading3",
      "text": "What counted"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "A recorded success means the person identified the requested action from the draft without a hint. A…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading3",
      "text": "Who is in each denominator"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Borrowing: 12 known outcomes. Returning: 11 known outcomes and 1 missing result. The twelve rows are…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading3",
      "text": "Limits and uncertainty"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "One draft, fixed task order and a small convenience sample cannot identify causes or predict use…"
    },
    {
      "style": "PosterNote",
      "text": "Shapes are reading cues, not charts. Their sizes carry no measured meaning."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "03 Square Evidence"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Descriptive task counts from the supplied synthetic session log. Each row uses its own known-outcome…"
    },
    {
      "style": "PosterNote",
      "text": "Missing results: Borrow 0; Return 1. No significance or causal estimate is claimed."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading3",
      "text": "Sources and permissions"
    },
    {
      "style": "PosterNote",
      "text": "R1 session-records.csv, records S01–S12. R2 STUDY-RECORD.md, task script and coding rule."
    },
    {
      "style": "PosterNote",
      "text": "Both sources are original fictional fixtures supplied with this template. The geometric illustration is…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading3",
      "text": "Discuss the next test"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Before approving a pilot, compare this claim with the task log and identify one plausible alternative…"
    }
  ],
